  <h3>Guitar</h3>
  <p>
    Classically trained guitarist under Croatian performer and educator 
    Natasha Klasinc-Lončar. Debuted a contemporary piece by 
    composer Miroslav Lončar during senior recital, and was selected twice 
    for the All-Virginia Guitar Ensemble (VMEA), representing Dominion High School.
  </p>
  <p>
    Placed in the Aguado Classical Guitar Competition in both individual 
    and chamber ensemble categories. Continues to play and sing 
    for fun.
  </p>

  <h3>Writing</h3>
  <p>
    Published creative nonfiction author, with work featured by 
    the Earl Gregg Swem Library at William & Mary.
  </p>

  <h3>Outdoors</h3>
  <p>
    Enjoys spending time outdoors, no matter the season, 
    and hiking alongside the Potomac with his family and German Shorthaired Pointer, Zorro.
  </p>

  <h3>Family & Balance</h3>
